extends ../../../../../designs/mockup-kit/page.pug

include ../mixins/start.pug

block title
  | icloud-backup — start · UI mockups

//-
  The sign-in flow: pre-flight, Apple ID and password, a turn, the code, and
  the hand-over. Copy and sample data are in src/data/start.mjs.

block page
  +mockPage('max-w-[1760px]')(class='page')
    +mockHead({ eyebrow: 'icloud-backup · /', title: 'Start', back: true })
      p The page a person sees until they are signed in. One thing to do per screen, so each step is its own screen: check two settings, give Apple the Apple ID and password, wait for a turn if someone else is signing in, then type the code from an Apple device. #[+code('Continue')] and #[+code('Sign in')] are the one accent button on their screens. Each state is a frame showing 1280 and 390 side by side.

    - const d = { appleId, preflight, signIn, waiting, code, handover }
    each s, i in screens
      +mockFrame(s.key, s.label, { num: String(i + 1).padStart(2, '0'), caption: s.caption })
        div(class='flex flex-wrap items-start gap-x-8 gap-y-6')
          div(class='flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-3')
            +startScreen('desktop', s, d)
            +frameLabel Desktop · 1280
          div(class='flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-3')
            +startScreen('mobile', s, d)
            +frameLabel Mobile · 390
